OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal sparks new leads in
OL,4,Aunsolved baby murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn image of a woman seen visiting the
OL,7,Fgrave of a baby found dead in 1995 has
OL,8,Fled to 25 new leads in two weeks,
OL,9,Faccording to a senior detective.
OL,11,FPolice investigating Baby April's death
OL,12,Freleased a computer-generated
OL,13,Fvisualisation in September of a woman
OL,14,Fseen in distress at her grave three
OL,15,Fmonths previously.
OL,17,FThe newborn was found dead at Singleton
OL,18,FLake in Ashford, Kent on 3 April 1995,
OL,19,Ftriggering a murder investigation.
OL,20,FDetectives believe she died from
OL,21,Fasphyxiation.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
