OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal sparks new leads in
OL,4,Aunsolved baby murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Neil Kimber of Kent Police
OL,7,Fsaid investigators "had a really good
OL,8,Fresponse" to their renewed appeal.
